# Seiche's speed dial through Graph tools' Speed picker (physics catalog plan,
# ruled 2026-10-04, "Speed select"): 1x by default; 50x applies when chosen,
# and on tree.html?nodes=300&seed=7&links=none&gpu=off, too large for fifty
# CPU ticks in the 8 ms budget, the speed reached shows beneath the picker;
# back at 1x the budget no longer binds.
assert snap ready == true
assert snap physics-speed == 1
click role:button Play physics
settle 2
assert snap physics-paused == false
click role:combobox Arrangement
settle 1
click role:option Free (physics alone)
settle 1
click role:button Apply arrangement
settle 1
assert snap layout == free
click role:combobox Speed
settle 1
click role:option 50x
settle 2
assert snap physics-speed == 50
assert text Speed set to 50x
settle 40
assert snap physics-budget-bound == true
assert text Running at
assert text the frame budget is full
capture p6_tree_speed_select_bound
click role:combobox Speed
settle 1
click role:option 1x
settle 4
assert snap physics-speed == 1
assert snap physics-budget-bound == false
log p6 speed select receipt complete
